  "description": "Element 2 is your fun, go-anywhere e-bike: a versatile adventure machine built for everything from neighborhood cruising to sandy paths, dirt trails, and campground roads. Its sporty frame and wide, grippy 20-inch fat tires deliver confident handling, stability, and comfort across changing terrain. Powerful electric assist helps flatten hills and extend every ride, while the integrated removable battery keeps the design sleek and balanced.\n\nPedego e-bikes use safe and reliable battery packs certified to UL 2271, and the complete system meets UL 2849 standards—the gold standard for electrical and fire safety—because you and your family deserve peace of mind on every ride. While many e-bike brands skip this step, Pedego puts safety first, so your only job is to get out there and have fun.",
